 "player_note": "The post (7 June 2000) says: \"This is the deck that I used at the comic con invitational of San Diego last year... The deck won all 3 of its regular games, and beat on Clayton Atkins DS Mains on Tatooine with SAC beatdown deck, thus going undefeated at an 80 man event\". It was built before Enhanced Cloud City and Enhanced Jabba's Palace."
